CHAPTER.VERS:
Hear this, O you

          {+}
         who would swallow up the needy, and cause the poor of the land to fail,

And I will turn your

          {+}
         feasts into mourning, and all your

          {+}
         songs into lamentation; and I will bring sackcloth on all loins, and baldness on every head; and I will make it as the mourning for an only son, and its end as a bitter day.
